        "\x1b[0;36m    Rune slots: \x1b[0m\x1b[0;33m1 (none fused)\x1b[0m\n\x1b[0m\n"
        "    [\x1b[0;31;1m1\x1b[0m] - \x1b[0;32mSelect Textile      \x1b[0m\x1b[0;34;1m   (*)\x1b[0m\n"
        "    [\x1b[0;31;1m2\x1b[0m] - \x1b[0;31mEnchant Robes       \x1b[0m\n"
